---

Why this agent matters

The main purpose of Agent 3 is retrieval optimization, not content generation.

Without Agent 3, a query like:

> "Show UK Trade Loan MT707 training for Business Champions"



relies mostly on semantic similarity.

With Agent 3, your retriever can first filter using metadata such as:

Product = Trade Loan

Country = UK

Audience = Business Champions

Knowledge Type = Training

SWIFT Message = MT707

Status = Approved


and then perform semantic search only on the matching chunks. This reduces irrelevant retrieval, improves precision, and makes your RAG system much more effective at enterprise scale.
